# Payment Services Unification

## Core Requirements
- Single service for payment operations
- Unified status handling
- Consistent error handling

## Implementation Locations
- Payment Config: [src/lib/config.ts](mdc:src/lib/config.ts)
- Payment Services: [src/services](mdc:src/services)
- Payment Components: [src/components](mdc:src/components)

## Payment Status Handling
```typescript
enum PaymentStatus {
  PENDING = 'pending',
  PROCESSING = 'processing',
  COMPLETED = 'completed',
  FAILED = 'failed'
}

interface PaymentResult {
  status: PaymentStatus;
  transactionId: string;
  amount: number;
  currency: string;
  error?: string;
}
```

## Integration Guidelines
1. Use TypeScript for type safety
2. Implement proper error handling
3. Handle webhooks consistently
4. Validate payment data
5. Log payment events

## Security Requirements
- Never log sensitive payment data
- Implement proper encryption
- Use secure communication
- Validate payment sources
- Handle refunds properly

